infinite-patch 1
# Neurofunk Modulated Reese Bass Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 36
  i note1 36
  i note2 36
  i note3 39
  i note4 36
  i note5 36
  i note6 48
  i note7 36
  i note8 36
  i note9 36
  i note10 39
  i note11 36
  i note12 36
  i note13 48
  i note14 39
